==========================================================
PROJECT SUMMARY
==========================================================

The Customer Product Productivity Analysis Dashboard is an interactive business intelligence application designed to analyze supply chain data efficiently. The dashboard transforms raw customer and product data into meaningful visual insights, allowing users to understand sales performance, profitability, customer distribution, and delivery trends.

The application is developed using Python and Streamlit, while Pandas is used for data processing and Plotly is used for creating interactive charts. The dashboard enables users to explore business information quickly without requiring technical knowledge.

==========================================================
PROJECT GOAL
==========================================================

The primary goal of this project is to provide an easy-to-use analytical dashboard that helps organizations understand their business performance through visualizations and key performance indicators.

==========================================================
BUSINESS PROBLEM
==========================================================

Organizations collect a large amount of customer and sales data every day. Without proper analysis, identifying profitable products, customer behavior, and sales trends becomes difficult. Manual analysis consumes time and often leads to inefficient decision-making.

This dashboard solves these challenges by presenting business information through interactive charts and summary statistics.

